    {
      "id": "claim_68e224d5f9dc4c04a7f6c7b66c180b7b",
      "statement": "FewShotPromptTemplate (string-based) formats examples into a single string via prefix, formatted examples, and suffix components joined by example_separator. It supports either static examples list or dynamic selection via example_selector (mutually exclusive). Example formatting uses an example_prompt PromptTemplate applied to each example.",
