    {
      "id": "claim_c0246de55b234265b2ce963bd73dde41",
      "statement": "BaseExampleSelector defines select_examples(input_variables: dict) → list[dict] for dynamic example selection and add_example() for adding new examples. SemanticSimilarityExampleSelector selects via vector similarity (requires VectorStore and embeddings model, with k parameter controlling result count). LengthBasedExampleSelector greedily includes examples up to max_length threshold determined by get_text_length callable.",
